WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:14.220
It’s project time! Retell a fairy tale in ScratchJr: storyboard it, use at least two pages, give it a beginning, middle and end, and make the characters talk and move.

2
00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:18.740
The Three Little Pigs, Goldilocks, the Gingerbread Man… pick one you know well.

3
00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:21.000
Draw the beginning, middle and end in three boxes.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.900
Use at least two pages, like the forest and the house.

5
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.690
Give your characters their famous lines!

6
00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:38.130
The gingerbread man says “Run, run!”, runs right 4, hops, and says “Can’t catch me!”.

7
00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:40.200
As fast as you can — you can’t catch him!

8
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:45.130
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

9
00:00:45.130 --> 00:00:48.380
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
